{
  "_comment": [
    "News and social sources. Tested 2026-10-28; status shows the result.",
    "Only sources with status 'ok' are fetched. 'no-feed' = no RSS exists; 'broken' = blocked or 404.",
    "cityHint: tags every item from that source with a city, even if the headline doesn't name it,",
    "and skips the location check (the source is already local to that city).",
    "userAgent 'browser': this site rejects bot-style requests, so we send a normal browser name.",
    "To add a source: copy an entry, change name/url, set status 'ok'. It's used on the next run."
